  m_Name: New QR Code Data 7
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SafetyTraining.QRCodeData
  qrCodeID: "\u015Eebeke / \u0130nvert\xF6r Enerji Se\xE7im Anahtar\u0131"
  title: "\u015Eebeke / \u0130nvert\xF6r Enerji Se\xE7im Anahtar\u0131"
  icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2a19aaadcf7844142a73ce60950ec353, type: 3}
  message: "Bu anahtar, test arac\u0131n\u0131n enerji kayna\u011F\u0131n\u0131 se\xE7mek
    i\xE7in kullan\u0131l\u0131r. Sistemin enerjisinin \u015Febekeden mi yoksa ara\xE7
    \xFCzerindeki invert\xF6rden mi al\u0131naca\u011F\u0131n\u0131 belirler. Ara\xE7
    ak\xFClerinin yeterli seviyede \u015Farjl\u0131 oldu\u011Fu durumlarda enerji
    invert\xF6rden sa\u011Flanabilir. Ak\xFC seviyesi yetersiz oldu\u011Funda ise
    ara\xE7 harici \u015Febeke beslemesine ba\u011Flanarak anahtar \u015Febeke konumuna
    al\u0131n\u0131r. Bu sayede test ekipmanlar\u0131n\u0131n kesintisiz ve g\xFCvenli
    \u015Fekilde \xE7al\u0131\u015Fmas\u0131 sa\u011Flan\u0131r."
